{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider\/effectBgBlur","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"effectBgBlur"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena","text":"EffectSemanticToken"}],"extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","role":"symbol","title":"effectBgBlur","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B31ThemeBarComponentTokensProviderC12effectBgBlur14CoreFoundation7CGFloatVvp"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider\/effectbgblur"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token EffectRawTokens.blur320 (= 32)"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effectBgBlur","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EffectSemanticToken","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/EffectSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider/effectBgBlur":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider\/effectBgBlur","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token EffectRawTokens.blur320 (= 32)"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"effectBgBlur"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic06EffectB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EffectSemanticToken"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"effectBgBlur","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider\/effectbgblur"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of bar"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBarComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BarComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of colors ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProviders"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and effects (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllEffectSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemebarcomponenttokensprovider"},"doc://OUDSTokensSemantic/documentation/OUDSTokensSemantic/EffectSemanticToken":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EffectSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/documentation\/OUDSTokensSemantic\/EffectSemanticToken","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Basically a semantic token for effect is a raw token for effect, to keep grammar clean and clear with design system grammar."}],"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EffectSemanticToken","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"EffectSemanticToken","url":"\/documentation\/oudstokenssemantic\/effectsemantictoken"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]}}}